## 11. Metrics, Events & Logs

### 11.1 Metrics
Dynatrace collects thousands of built-in metrics and supports custom metrics.

**Built-in Metric Categories:**
| Category | Examples |
|----------|---------|
| `builtin:host.cpu.*` | CPU usage, system, user, I/O wait |
| `builtin:host.mem.*` | Memory usage, available, page faults |
| `builtin:host.disk.*` | Disk reads/writes, utilization |
| `builtin:service.response.time` | Service response time |
| `builtin:service.errors.*` | Service failure rate, error count |
| `builtin:service.requestCount.*` | Service throughput |
| `builtin:apps.web.*` | RUM: user actions, load time, errors |
| `builtin:kubernetes.*` | Pod CPU/memory, node status |

**Metric Key Format:** `category.subcategory.metric`

