5. **Maintenance windows**: Schedule suppression during planned maintenance.

6. **Review custom events**: Remove duplicates or overly sensitive custom alerting rules.

7. **Problem correlation**: Ensure Smartscape topology is accurate so Davis can correlate properly — unlinked entities cause duplicate problems.

