## 23. Formulas & Calculations

### Apdex Score
```
Apdex = (Satisfied + 0.5 × Tolerating) / Total
Range: 0.0 (worst) to 1.0 (perfect)

Satisfied: response_time ≤ T
Tolerating: T < response_time ≤ 4T
Frustrated: response_time > 4T OR error
```

### Error Budget
```
Error Budget = 1 - SLO Target
Allowed downtime (minutes) = Error Budget × Days × 24 × 60

Example:
SLO = 99.95%
Error Budget = 0.05%
Monthly downtime allowed = 0.0005 × 30 × 24 × 60 = 21.6 minutes
```

### Service Availability
```
Availability % = (Successful Requests / Total Requests) × 100
```

### Error Rate
```
Error Rate % = (Failed Requests / Total Requests) × 100
```

### DDU (Davis Data Units) Estimation
```
DDUs = Custom metrics data points + Log lines (compressed) + Event count
1 DDU ≈ 1,000 custom metric data points
1 DDU ≈ ~300 KB of log data
```

